{"m_join": "<div class=\"w-screen\"><header class=\"w-head\"><div class=\"w-head-bar\"><button class=\"w-head-btn back\" aria-label=\"Back\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"/></svg></button></div><div class=\"w-head-text\"><h1>Join Clifton Savers</h1></div></header><div class=\"w-screen-body\"><div class=\"w-steps\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"\"></i></div><div class=\"w-title\"><h2>What you will pay</h2><p>Shown in full before you sign.</p></div><section class=\"w-card\"><div class=\"w-card-head\"><h3>Each month</h3></div><div class=\"w-facts c2\"><div><span>Instalment</span><b>Rs&nbsp;10,000</b></div><div><span>Fee</span><b>Rs&nbsp;85</b></div><div><span>PSP service fee, 1.5%</span><b>Rs&nbsp;150</b></div><div><span>Takaful fee</span><b>Set by the operator</b></div></div></section><section class=\"w-rowgroup\"><h4>Your turn</h4><div class=\"w-rowgroup-body\"><div class=\"w-row\"><span class=\"w-row-icon ok\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"/><path d=\"M16 2v4\"/><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3 10h18\"/><path d=\"m9 16 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></span><span class=\"w-row-text\"><b>Turn 11 of 12</b><small>New members start in the last three turns</small></span><span class=\"w-row-val ok\"><b>Rs&nbsp;120,000</b></span></div></div></section><section class=\"w-rowgroup\"><h4>Protections</h4><div class=\"w-rowgroup-body\"><div class=\"w-row\"><span class=\"w-row-icon \"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M9 14 4 9l5-5\"/><path d=\"M4 9h10.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 5.5 5.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1-5.5 5.5H11\"/></svg></span><span class=\"w-row-text\"><b>24 hours to withdraw</b><small>No cost if you change your mind</small></span></div><div class=\"w-row\"><span class=\"w-row-icon \"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 13v7a2 2 0 0 0 4 0\"/><path d=\"M12 2v2\"/><path d=\"M20.992 13a1 1 0 0 0 .97-1.274 10.284 10.284 0 0 0-19.923 0A1 1 0 0 0 3 13z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"w-row-text\"><b>Takaful</b><small>Pays you if a member stops after collecting</small></span></div><div class=\"w-row\"><span class=\"w-row-icon \"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m21 17-2.156-1.868A.5.5 0 0 0 18 15.5v.5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-2a1 1 0 0 1-1-1c0-2.545-3.991-3.97-8.5-4a1 1 0 0 0 0 5c4.153 0 4.745-11.295 5.708-13.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 3.31 3.284\"/><path d=\"M3 21h18\"/></svg></span><span class=\"w-row-text\"><b>Undertaking and mutual guarantee</b><small>Signed by every member</small></span></div></div></section></div><div class=\"w-bottom\"><button class=\"primary full\">Sign and join</button></div></div>"}